      "content": "thanks for this. it looks decent but i'm a little worried about the score. i just ran it through a sample checker and the score was kind of low because the keywords only appear once or twice. \n\ncan you try again? i really need that score to be much higher so i don't get filtered out immediately. try to weave those values in more deeply throughout the different paragraphs. again, please try to keep it sounding like a real person wrote it, don't make it a list or anything, just make sure those 5 keywords are more prominent so the score goes up.",
